# Lingui — compiled message catalogs (build artifact)
# `messages.mjs` is generated by `npm run i18n:compile` from
# `messages.po` (the human-edited source of truth). Tracking the
# compiled output causes spurious merge conflicts because every
# machine produces slightly different ordering. The build script
# (`npm run build` → `npm run i18n:compile && vite build`) and
# `npm run dev` regenerate it before bundling, so CI/prod always
# ships an up-to-date catalog.
src/shared/i18n/locales/*/messages.mjs

